<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="kk" translate="no" class="notranslate">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="google" content="notranslate">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Language" content="kk">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Шаңырақ көтеру тойы – Қуаныш пен Вера</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400;1,600&display=swap">
<style>
:root{--green:#0f3d2e;--deep:#0a2a20;--gold:#b8893a;--gold2:#e2c071;--cream:#f7efd9;--ink:#1c3a2d;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);color-scheme:light}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:inherit}
html{height:100%}
body{margin:0;min-height:100%;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top,#164d3a,var(--deep) 70%);background-color:var(--deep);font-family:'Noto Serif',Georgia,serif;color:var(--ink)}

/* envelope intro */
#intro{position:fixed;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:28px;z-index:5;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top,#164d3a,var(--deep) 70%);background-color:var(--deep);transition:opacity .9s ease,visibility .9s;padding:20px}
#intro.gone{opacity:0;visibility:hidden}
.env{position:relative;width:min(320px,82vw);aspect-ratio:3/2;background:var(--green);border:2px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.5);cursor:pointer;perspective:900px;animation:float 3.2s ease-in-out infinite}
.env::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,transparent 49.6%,var(--gold) 50%,transparent 50.4%),linear-gradient(225deg,transparent 49.6%,var(--gold) 50%,transparent 50.4%);opacity:.55;clip-path:polygon(0 100%,50% 40%,100% 100%)}
.flap{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:56%;background:#14503c;clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,50% 100%);transform-origin:top;transition:transform .8s ease;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)}
.seal{position:absolute;left:50%;top:56%;width:82px;height:82px;margin:-41px 0 0 -41px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%,var(--gold2),var(--gold));display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;font-size:11px;line-height:1.15;color:var(--deep);font-weight:600;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.45);transition:opacity .4s;z-index:2;border:3px double #fff6d6}
.env.open .flap{transform:rotateX(180deg)}
.env.open .seal{opacity:0}
.hint{color:var(--gold2);font-style:italic;font-size:16px;text-align:center;margin:0}
@keyframes float{50%{transform:translateY(-8px)}}

/* invitation */
main{display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:24px 14px 40px}
.card{position:relative;width:min(460px,100%);background:var(--cream);background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0,#fffaf0,transparent 60%);padding:34px 26px 30px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.55);opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px) scale(.97);transition:opacity 1s ease .2s,transform 1s ease .2s}
.card.show{opacity:1;transform:none}
.card::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:10px;border:1px solid var(--gold);pointer-events:none}
.card::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:15px;border:1px solid rgba(184,137,58,.45);pointer-events:none}
.corner{position:absolute;width:46px;height:46px;color:var(--gold)}
.c1{top:16px;left:16px}.c2{top:16px;right:16px;transform:scaleX(-1)}.c3{bottom:16px;left:16px;transform:scaleY(-1)}.c4{bottom:16px;right:16px;transform:scale(-1)}
.lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;margin:14px 8px 0;letter-spacing:.02em;color:var(--green)}
.names{font-style:italic;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(34px,10vw,46px);line-height:1.1;color:var(--green);margin:22px 0 6px}
.names span{display:block;font-size:.5em;color:var(--gold);font-weight:400;margin:2px 0}
.sub{font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;margin:10px 6px 0;color:var(--green);font-weight:600}
.div{display:block;margin:22px auto;width:190px;color:var(--gold)}
.when{font-style:italic;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--green);margin:0}
.when small{display:block;font-size:20px;color:var(--gold);margin-top:4px}
.ru{margin-top:8px}
.ru .lead{font-size:16px}
.ru .sub{font-size:16px;margin-top:10px}
.rl{margin:12px 6px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45}
.rl b{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold)}
.lbl{display:block;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:4px}
.count{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;margin:22px 4px 0}
.count div{border:1px solid var(--gold);padding:10px 0 8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.35)}
.count b{display:block;font-size:26px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--green)}
.count i{font-size:12px;color:#7a5a1f;font-style:normal}
.venue{margin:24px 4px 0;padding:18px 10px;border:1px solid var(--gold);outline:1px solid rgba(184,137,58,.4);outline-offset:4px;background:rgba(226,192,113,.18)}
.venue h2{margin:0;font-style:italic;font-size:30px;color:var(--green);font-weight:600}
.venue p{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:16px}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:16px;padding:11px 22px;background:var(--green);color:var(--gold2);text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;border:1px solid var(--gold);transition:background .2s,color .2s}
.btn:hover{background:var(--gold);color:var(--deep)}
.btn:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:3px}
.hosts{margin:26px 0 0;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.04em}
.hosts b{display:block;font-size:22px;font-style:italic;color:var(--green);margin-top:4px;font-weight:600}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.env{animation:none}.card,.flap,#intro{transition:none}}

.snd{position:fixed;right:14px;bottom:calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--gold);background:var(--green);color:var(--gold2);display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer;z-index:4;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .6s ease 1s;padding:0}
.snd.show{opacity:1;visibility:visible}
.snd:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:3px}
.snd svg{width:22px;height:22px}
.snd .off{display:none}.snd.muted .on{display:none}.snd.muted .off{display:block}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.snd{transition:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true">
<symbol id="cr" viewBox="0 0 46 46"><path d="M2 44V14C2 7 7 2 14 2h30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M10 34V16c0-4 2-6 6-6h18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M14 14c8 0 10 8 4 11s-10-3-6-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="26" cy="26" r="2.4" fill="currentColor"/></symbol>
<symbol id="dv" viewBox="0 0 190 14"><path d="M0 7h70M120 7h70" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M95 1l6 6-6 6-6-6z" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="78" cy="7" r="2.2" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="112" cy="7" r="2.2" fill="currentColor"/></symbol>
</svg>

<div id="intro">
  <div class="env" id="env" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Шақыруды ашу">
    <div class="flap"></div>
    <div class="seal">Онлайн<br>шақыру</div>
  </div>
  <p class="hint">Ашу үшін түртіңіз</p>
</div>

<main>
  <article class="card" id="card">
    <svg class="corner c1"><use href="#cr"/></svg><svg class="corner c2"><use href="#cr"/></svg>
    <svg class="corner c3"><use href="#cr"/></svg><svg class="corner c4"><use href="#cr"/></svg>

    <p class="lead">Құрметті ағайын-туыс, құда-жекжат, дос-жаран!</p>
    <p class="sub" style="margin-top:14px">Сіздерді</p>
    <h1 class="names">Қуаныш<span>пен</span>Вераның</h1>
    <p class="sub" style="margin-top:0">шаңырақ көтеру тойының қадірлі қонағы болуға шақырамыз!</p>

    <svg class="div" viewBox="0 0 190 14"><use href="#dv"/></svg>

    <p class="when"><em class="lbl">Уақыты:</em>19 желтоқсан 2026 жыл<small>Сағат: 19:00</small></p>

    <div class="count" id="count" aria-label="Тойға дейін қалған уақыт">
      <div><b id="d">0</b><i>күн</i></div>
      <div><b id="h">0</b><i>сағат</i></div>
      <div><b id="m">0</b><i>минут</i></div>
      <div><b id="s">0</b><i>секунд</i></div>
    </div>

    <div class="venue">
      <em class="lbl">Болатын орны:</em><h2>«Гузель»</h2>
      <p>мейрамханасы</p>
      <p>Әбілқайыр хан 2Б</p>
      <a class="btn" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=%D0%93%D1%83%D0%B7%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C+%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%B9%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D1%85%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%8B+%D3%98%D0%B1%D1%96%D0%BB%D2%9B%D0%B0%D0%B9%D1%8B%D1%80+%D1%85%D0%B0%D0%BD+2%D0%91" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Қалай жетуге болады</a>
    </div>

    <p class="hosts">Той иелері:<b>Амантай-Сағира</b></p>
  <section class="ru" lang="ru" translate="no">
      <svg class="div" viewBox="0 0 190 14"><use href="#dv"/></svg>
      <p class="lead">Дорогие родные, близкие и друзья!</p>
      <p class="sub">Приглашаем вас стать почётными гостями Дня свадьбы Куаныша и Веры!</p>
      <p class="rl"><b>Время</b>19 декабря 2026 года, в 19:00</p>
      <p class="rl"><b>Место</b>ресторан «Гузель», Әбілқайыр хан 2Б</p>
      <p class="rl"><b>Хозяева торжества</b>Амантай-Сағира</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</main>

